  m_text: '== CAMERA ==

    W A S D   -->   Move camera



    Q / E   -->   Rotate camera



    Mouse Wheel   -->   Zoom in / out



    Shift + WASD   -->   Move camera faster



    == UNITS & COMBAT ==



    Left Click   -->   Select unit / move / target



    Tab / Shift + Tab   -->   Cycle friendly units



    Right Click   -->   Inspect unit / cancel targeting



    Esc   -->   Cancel targeting / close inspection



    Enter   -->   End turn



    == OTHER ==

    Page Up / Down   -->   Change floor



    Numpad 9 / 3   -->   Change floor



    P   -->   Pause / resume

'
